    ],
    "module_designation": "Indicator module",
    "description": "Indicator module type MicroPACK'R, presented as a separate module intended to be integrated in a non-automatic weighing instrument (it may also be integrated in an automatic gravimetric filling instrument (Ref(0,2)) or in an automatic catchweigher of category XIII). It is intended to be connected to 1 or 2 weighing channels comprising strain gauge load cells with analogue output. It performs analogue to digital conversion of the signal, manages the inputs and outputs and the different communication interfaces. It holds in its memory the metrological parameters of each connected weighing channel; it is not possible to change these parameters without breaking the sealing device."
  },
